  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for Equality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is based on a multi-level approach where the core of the intervention is engaging youth at the grassroot level in Iraq, providing them with training needed to organize community based initiatives aimed at increasing local support for gender equality, and using the results from the local level as a basis for influencing stakeholders and decision makers at the regional and central governmental level. The activities will take place in areas where IAAA are represented/have offices Anbar, Dhi Qar, Najaf, Kirkuk and Baghdad.</narrative>
  </description>
